// Between Route 5 and Ashgrove. The rockTunnel gate (Flash: hmFlash from
// south + the Stone Badge) keeps it shut until the player can light it.

## The dark

::bg{location="lantern-tunnel" time="night"}
::music{action="change" mood="eerie" volume="down"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: Old lamp brackets line the tunnel walls, every one of them empty. The dark swallows the light from outside after three steps.
@narrator{code="0020"}: Your monster's Flash fills the tunnel with white. Something with a lot of legs leaves in a hurry.
@narrator{code="0030"}: Hand-painted on the wall, faded: ASHGROVE, 2 MILES. MIND THE HIKERS.
